~ start
Imagine Islander: Hi StoryWeaver!
Imagine Islander: Let me give you some advice for exploring the archipelago.
Imagine Islander: Whenever you get lost trying out some new mechanics, just open up the game menu and click "Abandon Quest". It will bring you right back to the island.
Imagine Islander: If you stumble across something you like, open the debug settings from the options menu and click "Open Current Scene In Editor" to take a closer look at how the scene works.
Imagine Islander: One more thing. Sometimes helpful information appears in the editor but isn't included on the signs. In the editor, you can right-click a node and choose "Open Documentation" to get more details.
Imagine Islander: Good luck and let your imagination lead you!
=> END
